Hi,
factors are always messy...
In this case, it's probably easiest to convert it to 1-based indices first, e.g. with
  as.numeric(as.factor(timeID))

Example:
> as.numeric(as.factor(c(4,6,10,11,6)))
[1] 1 2 3 4 2

Finn

